{"availability":"available","full":"richiekaroki/php-blog-project-backend","name":"php-blog-project-backend","description":"A secure PHP blog backend with admin panel, REST API, and PostgreSQL. Features role-based access control, image uploads, search/filter pagination, and hardened security (CSRF, XSS prevention, rate limiting, session hardening). Runs on Laravel Herd.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-10-10T22:18:07Z","updated":"2026-09-08T12:42:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://php-blog-backend.onrender.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://php-blog-backend.onrender.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.172Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.172Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.172Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:38:23.172Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A secure, passwordless blog platform: PHP 8.4 backend, Vue 3 public SPA, Neon PostgreSQL, deployed on Render as a single Docker container."],"features":["🔑 Passwordless magic links — HMAC-SHA256 signed tokens, single-use (atomic INSERT … ON CONFLICT), 10-minute expiry, no account-leaking responses.","🛡️ Optional TOTP 2FA — RFC 6238, no external dependencies; enrollment requires proof-of-possession, disable requires the current code.","🧾 Server-side session registry — every login recorded in authsessions; logout & \"sign out other devices\" revoke sessions instantly.","🚦 DB-backed IP rate limiting — magic-link requests, 2FA attempts, and API requests all capped per-minute, keyed on hashed IP (cookies can't reset it).","👥 Role-based access control — admin (full), editor (create/edit), viewer (read-only), enforced server-side on the API and PHP admin pages."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/richiekaroki/php-blog-project-backend/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7dd419d274bf6729a15078eb1bd354736f7640d6be32437fcfddfe5ee88900cf","extractedAt":"2026-10